## 🔄 Workflow: From Brief to Final Assets

```
START
  ↓
[LOGO_FINAL_BRIEF.md] — Confirm specs with stakeholders
  ↓
VECTOR FINALIZATION
  ├─ Designer creates vector master in Adobe Illustrator
  ├─ Uses LOGO_VARIANT_SPECS.md for exact sizing/format
  └─ Exports: .ai master + .svg + all raster sizes
  ↓
3D MODEL PRODUCTION
  ├─ 3D artist reads 3D_CREATION_PROMPT.md
  ├─ Builds Blender file with provided material node graph
  ├─ Renders: 4K cosmic render + icon variant
  └─ Delivers: .blend file + EXR/PNG outputs
  ↓
ASSET ORGANIZATION
  ├─ Use master file inventory structure
  ├─ Quality checklist verification
  └─ All formats tested and optimized
  ↓
DISTRIBUTION
  ├─ Web team: SVG + PNG icon (512px)
  ├─ Marketing: High-res renders + variants
  ├─ Print vendor: CMYK separations
  ├─ App developers: Icon package (all sizes)
  └─ Documentation: Watermark versions
  ↓
END ✅
```

